# A mate in 2 ("Small step", third row of the third column at (1124, 346)): the first turn Qc1-c2, then the engine's reply is played on the
# board and the puzzle waits for the second turn. Then Show solution replays the stored line from the start.
wait 20
click 150 370        # Puzzles
wait 40
click 1124 346       # Small step
wait 40
clicksq 0 2 c1
wait 20
clicksq 0 2 c2
wait 60
click 842 90         # Submit
move 880 740
wait 240
capture puzzles-mate2-replied
click 1176 704       # Show solution
move 880 740
wait 500
capture puzzles-solution-shown
